# Static-host header config (Netlify/Cloudflare Pages syntax).
# COOP + COEP are REQUIRED: without cross-origin isolation there is no
# SharedArrayBuffer, and therefore no threaded WASM inference.
#
# CORP is intentionally `cross-origin`. It controls who may embed a resource,
# and `same-origin` on the top-level document makes the app unloadable inside
# any cross-origin iframe (preview proxies, docs embeds) — a silent blank frame
# with no console error. Isolation comes from COOP + COEP, not from this header.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: cross-origin
